<%
const email = (typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings && settings.email) ? settings.email : '{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}';
const phone = (typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings && settings.phone) ? settings.phone : '{{COMPANY_PHONE}}';
const address = (typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings && settings.address) ? settings.address : '{{COMPANY_ADDRESS}}';
%>
<style>
  .legal-page .legal-content { max-width: 820px; }
  .legal-page .legal-content h2 { margin-top: 2.25rem; }
  .legal-page .legal-content h3 { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .legal-page .legal-content p,
  .legal-page .legal-content li { line-height: 1.7; }
  .legal-page .legal-content ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.75rem 0; }
  .legal-page .legal-updated { opacity: 0.7; font-size: 0.95rem; }
</style>

<div class="legal-page">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
        </svg>
        Home
      </a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">This policy is effective as of the date first posted and may be updated from time to time; the current version always governs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>{{COMPANY_LEGAL_NAME}} ("{{COMPANY_NAME}}," "we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have. It applies to <a href="{{COMPANY_WEBSITE}}">{{COMPANY_WEBSITE}}</a> and the services we provide.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Information you provide.</strong> Your name, email address, phone number, mailing address, and any details you include when you submit a form, request a quote, book a service, or contact us.</li>
        <li><strong>Automatically collected information.</strong> Basic device and usage data such as IP address, browser type, pages visited, and referring links, collected through cookies and similar technologies.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and provide the services you request.</li>
        <li>To schedule, confirm, and follow up on appointments and jobs.</li>
        <li>To send you updates, receipts, and — where you have opted in — offers and promotions.</li>
        <li>To improve our website and services, and to comply with our legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. SMS / Text Messaging</h2>
      <p>If you provide your mobile phone number and opt in — by checking the consent box on a form, texting us, or replying to a message — we may send you text messages related to your inquiry, appointments, service updates, and (if you agreed) offers.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply.</li>
        <li>You can opt out at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong>. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help.</li>
        <li>Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of any purchase.</li>
        <li><strong>We do not sell, rent, or share your mobile phone number or SMS opt-in consent with any third parties or affiliates for their own marketing purposes.</strong> Text messaging opt-in data is used solely to deliver the messages you requested.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. How We Share Information</h2>
      <p>We share your information only as needed to operate our business:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service providers</strong> who help us run our website, communications, scheduling, and payments, and who are bound to protect your information.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal and safety reasons</strong> when required by law or to protect our rights, property, or safety.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>As stated above, mobile phone numbers and SMS opt-in data are never shared with third parties or affiliates for their own marketing.</p>

      <h2>5. Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and similar technologies to operate the site, remember your preferences, and understand how the site is used. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>7. Your Choices</h2>
      <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, and you may opt out of marketing communications at any time. To make a request, contact us using the details below.</p>

      <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our services are not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes take effect when posted on this page.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at:</p>
      <p>
        {{COMPANY_LEGAL_NAME}}<br/>
        <%= address %><br/>
        <a href="mailto:<%= email %>"><%= email %></a><br/>
        <a href="tel:<%= phone.replace(/[^0-9+]/g, '') %>"><%= phone %></a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
